# Homes for tracked paths in no package. Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a
# package, and every package has a home); provisional.
#
# calef, 2026-09-27: "Everything in the tree may not be in a package, but it may be in a repo." A
# package's paths take the package's home, in packages/<name>.package. Everything else is claimed
# here, one `path <prefix> <home>` per line, and the longest prefix naming a file wins across both.
# The grammar is helpers/packages.py's header; the reasons are notes/package-boundaries.md.
#
# The end state is that everything leaves this repository, so "undecided" is allowed and counted,
# and every undecided line says in a few words what the decision is waiting on. Nothing here is a
# default: a new top-level directory has no home until somebody writes one.

# The project's own records. Whether this repository becomes their home or they leave too is open.
path design/ undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path briefs/ undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path AGENTS.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path CLAUDE.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path ARCHITECTS.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path CONTRIBUTING.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path SECURITY.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path README.md undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path art/ undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call
path packages/homes undecided project records; whether this repository keeps them is calef's call

# Documentation. Site, package or records is open: design/roadmap/proposals/a-documentation-site.md.
path notes/ undecided documentation; the site, a package or the records is an open question
path vendor/README.md undecided documentation; the site, a package or the records is an open question
path vendor/upstream-status.md undecided documentation; the site, a package or the records is an open question

# The build, the gates and CI. They follow whichever repository integrates the image.
path script/ undecided the build and gates follow the integrating repository, not yet named
path helpers/ undecided the build and gates follow the integrating repository, not yet named
path .github/ undecided the build and gates follow the integrating repository, not yet named
path .githooks/ undecided the build and gates follow the integrating repository, not yet named
path .claude/ undecided the build and gates follow the integrating repository, not yet named
path bench/ undecided measurements; they follow the integrating repository, not yet named

# The workspace root: one Cargo workspace spans every package until the first one moves.
path Cargo.toml undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path Cargo.lock undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path rust-toolchain.toml undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path .cargo/ undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path .gitignore undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path clippy.toml undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path rustfmt.toml undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path deny.toml undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path _typos.toml undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path .qemu-version undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path .cargo-deny-version undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path .cargo-fuzz-version undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path .cargo-mutants-version undecided the workspace root dissolves as packages move out
path LICENSE-MIT undecided every repository carries its own copy; this one follows the root
path LICENSE-APACHE undecided every repository carries its own copy; this one follows the root
